WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:48.420
Someone once said...

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:53.250
There are trees full of gigantic, 
soft, fatty mackerel...

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:57.190
Salted Mackewillows!

00:01:57.690 --> 00:02:01.060
And there's a jungle made of 
various flavors of gummi drops,

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:03.600
like strawberry, melon, and chocolate...

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.500
Jungummi!

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:09.500
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:14.510
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:17.310 --> 00:02:22.450
Once every 100 years, a legendary 
soup appears... Century Soup!

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:25.690
Toriko and Komatsu set out for Ice Hell,

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:27.920
the continent of ice where 
the frozen soup defrosts.

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:31.060
After Toriko and his fellow Gourmet 
Hunters arrive at Ice Hell,

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:32.930
they push their way through separate routes

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:35.530
towards the Ice Mountain 
where the soup idly lies.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:40.900
And a Vice Chef of the Gourmet Corp., 
Tommyrodd, also enters the fray.

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:44.940
The scramble for the Century 
Soup is heating up even more!

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:51.380
Hurry While It's Hot! A Survival Race on Ice!

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:10.460
Toriko-san has been standing 
guard the whole time...

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:14.600
Is that an indication of how fierce 
the creatures are out there?

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.670
He must be cold...

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:25.110
The gatekeeper of the ice world...

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:27.980
Whatever killed it...

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:30.550
...is something far out of the ordinary.

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:39.120
Let me take a shift, Toriko.

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.460
Thank you for this afternoon...

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:47.700
For saving my guy.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.670
Hmph. So you wanna show your gratitude?

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:51.300
You're a conscientious mafioso.

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:54.200
The name is Match. Good to meet you.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:57.710
I'm Toriko. Well, we might as well cooperate.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:59.540
For now, anyway...

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:07.420
Like I thought, this is the safest route!

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:10.150
And it keeps the strong wind 
out! This way's a cinch!

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:13.420
This is going smoothly... <i>Too</i> smoothly...

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.260
Going by our experiences up to now...

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:18.830
...there's no way this luck's gonna hold out!

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.230
The soup's as good as ours!

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:26.740
Uh-huh. I know! Let's christen 
this safe route "Victory Road"!

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:34.940
Z-Z-Zonge-sama!

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:37.610
I knew this would happen...

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.680
Growlruses!

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.080
You're too loud!

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.750
You'll wake 'em up!

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:47.120
Growlruses are nicknamed "Amphibious Demons"!

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.320
And we ran into 'em this early on!

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:51.130
The bosses of this continent!

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:52.760
Growlruses are the boss?

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:54.230
Of course, what'd you think?!

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:57.830
Far as I know, there ain't any stronger 
creatures on the whole danged planet!

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:01.270
They're the strongest, evilest animals 
in the world, and I ain't lyin'!

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:04.940
Uh, that dragon we saw back 
there looked a lot stronger...

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:07.140
What are you, an idiot?! That wasn't real!

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.510
There's no way somethin' 
like that really exists!

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:10.680
This is the first time I've 
seen Growlruses in the wild!

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:12.610
What a heaping helping of awesomeness!

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:17.450
You're too frickin' loud! What 
do we do if they wake up?!

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.940
Century Soup, you say?!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:38.040
Yes. We have information 
that the Gourmet Corp.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:41.680
has already made a move to capture the soup.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:45.950
They failed to capture the Jewel Meat before.

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:49.550
I believe they'll send out 
their big guns this time.

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:50.880
And then some...

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.820
Did you just say "handsome"?!

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:54.250
I certainly did not!

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:59.160
Apparently, Toriko is already 
on the trail of the soup.

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:02.330
But perhaps the other Kings 
should get involved, too...

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:06.730
The Gourmet Corp... Just who 
are they gonna send out?!

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:15.670
So, where is the Century Soup, Bogie?

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:17.140
Yes, Tommy-sama.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:20.010
They say a sparkling aurora around 
an iceberg marks the spot.

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:21.850
Then let's head out.

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:24.280
Oh, it seems as though there 
are other Gourmet Hunters, too.

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:26.690
What should we do, Vice Chef?

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:29.250
It's obvious, Barry...

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:31.420
We wipe them out.

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:37.260
Is everyone all right?!

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:42.330
Yeah! Although behind me, 
everyone but my men dropped out!

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:45.500
The lighter suits can't 
take any more than this!

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.770
What is this cold?!

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:52.340
Even though it's morning, the sun 
is totally blocked by the clouds.

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:54.880
That's why the temperature is dropping!

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:00.080
I'm worried about Komatsu...

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.020
He's losing body heat...

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.820
Hey, I see something!

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:06.760
That's...

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:10.760
Green land...

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:14.600
Looks like it was frozen 
instantly by the blizzard.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:17.800
If we don't hurry, we'll 
end up the same way...

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:19.440
What's this?

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:23.870
Dietary Fiber, Potassium, Sugar 
Content, Capsaicin, Measuring...

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:26.910
Hot Mushroom, Height 15-20cm, 
Weight 150g, Capture Level < 1

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:26.880
Like I thought, a Hot Mushroom...

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:29.780
Komatsu, eat! It'll warm you up a little.

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.650
It's kind of spicy...

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:34.780
But my body is warming up.

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:36.890
I feel better now.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:39.160
Please have some, Toriko-san.

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:42.460
You've hardly had anything to eat today.

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:44.930
And I'm fine now.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:48.130
Komatsu... You...

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:52.770
Even in a situation like this, he worries 
about other people more than himself.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:00.840
Komatsu, thanks for the offer, but...

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:03.010
You eat the food!

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:07.220
Toriko-san... Thank you!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:18.560
Toriko-san! It's really spicy when you 
shove the whole thing in my mouth!

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:21.760
My tongue's on fire! Feels 
like my tongue's on fire!

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.360
Sorry!

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:23.770
<i>That's</i> what the tears were from?!

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:32.110
Freezer Bison!

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:33.770
Even though we're in a hurry...

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:35.980
No, we're lucky.

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:39.180
I hear Freezer Bison meat is delicious.

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:43.080
Besides that, their pelts 
can shield us from the cold.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.320
I see!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:48.060
And a little exercise will warm us up, too.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.530
Leave this to me!

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:53.290
I go forth!

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:10.110
Takimaru-san's movements...

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:12.910
That's his pre-shot routine.

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:15.010
Pre-shot routine?

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:17.220
Yeah. Before he unleashes a technique,

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:20.890
he does set moves to 
increase his concentration.

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:23.320
After his concentration level is way up,

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:26.290
he can get a solid image of 
his technique succeeding.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:31.730
It's just like how I rub my hands 
together before using my Fork and Knife.

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:33.430
I see.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.970
Everyone has their own pre-shot routine.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:39.240
And the higher the quality of the routine,

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:42.410
the more you can expect 
out of the performance.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:53.990
Corkscrew Shot!

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:08.130
Well, that's one out of the way...

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:09.500
W-Wow!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.840
His power of concentration is amazing.

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.370
Increase the quality of your pre-shot routine

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:16.370
and the might of your 
technique increases, I say.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:25.480
There it is! Match-san is relaxing...

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:34.990
His state of relaxation...

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:38.400
The more he relaxes...

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:42.330
...the more Match-san's 
sword-drawing speed...

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:46.000
...and its destructive power increase!

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.320
As expected from Match-san!

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.050
Incredible!

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:09.660
Three-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:19.100
Whoa...

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:22.670
Nope, I don't wanna make an enemy out of him.

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:26.710
Looks like more are coming...

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.990
Three of 'em should be plenty.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:49.260
There's no need to be wasteful by 
killing more than what's necessary.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:50.830
Toriko...?

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:57.070
"I'm gonna annihilate 
every last one of ya..."

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.010
Huh...

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:02.610
I guess even among the Four Kings, 
there are major differences...

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:05.380
Toriko-san!

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:08.280
I'm gonna prepare the pelts!

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:11.820
This one has respect for all life.

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:27.230
Looks like the second group.

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:31.640
They're all frozen stiffs 
now! Serves 'em right!

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:36.080
I-In a place like this...?

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:38.640
Me, Bourbo-sama...?

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:42.880
You didn't think you'd die here?

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:49.990
Bye-bye!

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:53.430
And with that, all the members of 
the second group are stamped out.

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:54.360
Not quite...

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:57.700
One person has made his way over yonder.

00:12:57.700 --> 00:12:59.560
And in a calm fashion...

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:01.100
That Toriko guy?

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:05.870
No. Toriko was with the first group and 
their footprints are long gone by now.

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:08.970
It's no one from Toriko's group and 
not one of ours from Gourmet Corp...

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.840
Then it must be somebody else!

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:13.680
At any rate, he knows what he's doing.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.410
I wonder who he is...

00:13:15.410 --> 00:13:17.250
It's a pain, but ah, well...

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:19.220
I'll try attacking him first.

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:20.820
Attacking?!

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:23.150
Vice Chef, here?!

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:24.720
I-It's dangerous! Outta the way!

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.060
How does the bison pelt feel, Komatsu?

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:34.230
Warm! Thank you!

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:36.300
This'll take the edge off the cold.

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:37.630
This helps a lot.

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:42.710
I give thanks to this world's 
great bounty. Let's eat!

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:45.040
Thank you!

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.940
Delicious! It's light and goes down smooth!

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:49.250
And when you cook it over a flame,

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:52.880
it brings out a soy sauce-like 
flavor that makes it even tastier!

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:55.090
Although it cools off quickly here...

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:56.750
In the middle of this blizzard...

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:58.350
In these circumstances...

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:01.520
Those two are savoring their meal.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:09.200
Let's hurry on ahead!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:12.230
Once we get to the Ice Mountain, 
this wind should die down.

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:13.100
Right!

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:28.820
Barf Weevil (Insect Beast) Capture Level 39

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:33.820
Armor Hoi Hoi (Insect Beast) Capture Level 35

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:38.860
Rock Bee (Insect Beast) Capture Level 37

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:43.400
Jam Grasshopper (Insect 
Beast) Capture Level 40

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:47.170
Fancy using you in a place like this.

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:50.340
Go and feed upon your prey...

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:52.470
...my parasite bugs!

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:57.410
Okay, they're gone!

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:59.110
Vice Chef!

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:01.850
If you're going to spit your 
bugs out, give us fair warning!

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:03.680
Don't worry!

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:06.220
They indiscriminately eat their 
way into the prey from the anus

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:08.160
and lay eggs in the intestine.

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:11.530
You see, they're kind and not 
too dangerous parasite bugs...

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:13.260
That's plenty dangerous!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.060
Vice Chef!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.830
You want dangerous?

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:22.370
Now this guy is dangerous!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:26.510
Now, shall we hurry along?

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.350
We made it!

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:41.720
This is Ice Hell's Ice Mountain!

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:46.860
W-We're finally... here...

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:48.830
Komatsu!

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:52.470
Somehow... I made it here alive...

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:54.770
Yeah. You did great.

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:56.870
You've got guts...

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:59.640
You men really hung in there, too.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:02.010
I'm glad you all made it here safely.

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:09.180
If you'd been done in by nature, I don't 
know who I'd've taken revenge against!

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:10.950
Match-san...

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:16.290
Toriko-san, shall we take a short rest?

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:18.190
No. Let's press on.

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:22.460
The Century Soup is somewhere 
in this Ice Mountain!

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.500
Act now and it's your lucky day!

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:27.130
Wait until tomorrow, and luck 
will never come your way!

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:30.500
All right, let's go! I wanna drink that soup!

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:33.540
Don't tell me... Toriko's just hungry...?

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:36.070
That's it exactly.

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:38.740
Hurry up, you guys!

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:41.810
Your drool's turned into icicles!

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.980
It's dangerous here...

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.320
Whoa!

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:47.520
What happened to your safe route?!

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.050
A-And it's a heaping 
helping of freezing, too!

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:50.150
What are you talking about?!

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:51.560
It was a piece of cake 
gettin' past the Growlruses,

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:53.260
the bosses of this continent, wasn't it?

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:55.360
This is the simple route, 
no two ways about it!

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:58.300
We ain't gonna be facin' any 
more dangers, I tell ya!

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:00.760
There, look at that! The path gets wider!

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:02.230
That's our Zonge-sa...

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:09.510
Ice Jaguar (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 17

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.140
What the hell is that?!

00:17:08.140 --> 00:17:09.510
An Ice Jaguar?!

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:11.940
Idiot! You ever heard of 
barbed wire like this?!

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:14.140
What I said was <i>jaguar</i>!

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:15.710
What the hell is that?! I dunno!

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:18.180
Any way you look at it, it's gotta 
be stronger than the Growlruses!

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:20.380
Run away! I mean, let's go home!

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:22.950
I mean, I hate this 
continent! It's too scary!

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:27.220
As long as this is happening, I'm gonna 
get a big, heaping scoop out of it!

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:30.960
Here we go!

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:42.600
Is this game over?!

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:44.940
Don't worry. I made sure to save it.

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:46.680
It really is important to save your game...

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:47.640
What am I saying?!

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:49.540
I hate bad endings!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:50.850
We're in the worst pinch!

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:52.880
Whatever will become of us?!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.750
You'll find out after these commercials!

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:57.290
She's reporting at a time like this!!

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.730
You guys okay?

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.130
Yes!! We were saved, Zonge-sama!

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:12.700
I told ya I saved the game, didn't I?!

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:13.800
Th-This is...

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:19.670
What the hell is this?!

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:21.080
Th-This is a...

00:18:21.610 --> 00:18:23.810
A hidden cave that leads to the Ice Mountain!

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:26.380
This was the right route after all!

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:28.050
That's our Zonge-sama!

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:30.150
As always, you've got what it takes!

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:34.520
This man has the devil's 
own luck! It's incredible!

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:36.860
Unbelievable...

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:19.100
This ice is so beautiful!

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:22.670
I had no idea that ice in Ice 
Hell could be this gorgeous!

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:25.700
Komatsu, you can take off the pelt now.

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:27.540
I can?

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:30.280
You're right! It's warmer than before!

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:33.550
Just as I thought! There's no wind here.

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:38.150
Once every hundred years, Hell Methane 
Hydrate warms up the Ice Mountain

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:41.850
and the heat from that throws this 
continent's air currents out of whack,

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:43.720
which in turn produces a strong wind.

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:47.930
Then we came to Ice Hell during 
its most dangerous period...

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:52.660
But if we didn't come now, we'd never 
be able to get the melted Century Soup.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:58.140
True, but... That green area and even 
the gatekeeper of the ice world,

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:00.640
the Tundra Dragon, were frozen.

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:03.170
A blizzard like that 
wouldn't have frozen it...

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:05.180
Not if it had been alive...

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:10.080
It was frozen from the blizzard 
only after its life had been taken.

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:11.720
H-How?!

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:16.350
A Tundra Dragon's Capture 
Level is easily over 50!

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:17.690
Yep.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:19.820
Who could've done that?!

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:32.100
Tommy-sama! That's...

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:36.510
Your bugs have been killed?!

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:37.770
No.

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:39.310
They've been knocked.

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:42.310
But their Capture Level is nearly 40!

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:47.320
The person who knows how 
to knock these rare bugs...

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:50.750
Could it be... him?!

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:20.580
I'm grumble-grumble hungry! 
My tummy's rumble rumblin'!

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:24.850
Today we're out there: Ack 
SOS, I'm in trouble yes!

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:28.220
Gotta go! Gotta go! Can't 
leave this alone, right?

00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:31.690
Giving you support and cheer, 
the duties are endless!

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:35.060
Burnin' up! Bustin' out! Trouble buster!

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:38.130
Oh my god! A heaping helping of energy!

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:41.900
When I'm hungry I can't get any power!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.470
Go, fight! At attention to you!

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:48.610
Two-way communication!

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:52.110
The encouragement I get 
from you is my nourishment!

00:21:52.380 --> 00:21:55.880
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:59.250
Our future looks to be tasty!

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:01.090
Right? OK. Left? OK.

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:05.790
Be careful, courageously! Right on, let's go!

00:22:05.790 --> 00:22:09.360
Fight with bravery!

00:22:09.360 --> 00:22:13.070
Deli-deli delicious, and let's eat!

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:19.610
Gourmet News.

00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:22.140
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:24.540
Today, I'm going to introduce a 
recipe that will let you taste

00:22:24.540 --> 00:22:27.780
a flavor similar to Freezer Bison at home.

00:22:27.780 --> 00:22:31.150
First, place a weight on top of frozen tofu,

00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:34.750
let all the water drain out and 
make sure it thoroughly defrosts.

00:22:34.750 --> 00:22:38.820
Cut it into little pieces and fry it up 
with garlic until it turns light brown.

00:22:38.820 --> 00:22:41.460
Finally, put some soy sauce on it...

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:44.930
And we're done! Thank you for the food!

00:22:47.000 --> 00:22:48.470
It tastes just like meat!

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:50.770
So soft and fluffy!

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:53.970
And since tofu is healthy, you 
can eat as much as you want!

00:22:54.410 --> 00:22:57.210
I think it'll be even better 
with a heaping helping of rice!

00:22:58.080 --> 00:23:00.140
I ate too much of a good thing!

00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:02.510
Take care not to overeat!

00:23:02.510 --> 00:23:04.280
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:07.020 --> 00:23:09.220
A lone warrior marches up the frozen mountain!

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:11.070
Is he an enemy? Or a friend?

00:23:11.070 --> 00:23:13.190
His true identity is bound to be a scoop!

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:16.630
The Explosive Fire Shakes Ice Mountain! The Identity of the Masked Man!

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:18.730
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
